{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Stack-Cairn.LiveAgent","latestVersion":"2.0.9","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 Stack-Cairn","description":"A local-first AI agent desktop client that deeply integrates large language model reasoning with local system tools.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 Stack-Cairn","description":"A local-first AI agent desktop client that deeply integrates large language model reasoning with local system tools.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"LiveAgent is a local-first AI agent desktop client. It deeply integrates large language model reasoning with local system tools, so the AI can genuinely operate your file system, run commands, and manage scheduled tasks — while the Gateway enables remote access and collaboration.","name":"LiveAgent","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent","publisher":"Stack-Cairn","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn","releaseNotes":"LiveAgent v2.0.9\n内置 K-brain v0.107.18（#1210）。\n修复\n- 任务不会再在中途停住（#1208、K-brain#118）：模型在后台等待构建、命令或后台进程时，以前一轮对话结束就会把它们一起取消，模型再也收不到结果，任务停在半路。现在等待和后台进程会继续运行，完成后自动唤醒对话继续任务。手动停止或关闭会话时，它们仍会一起停掉。\n- 后台通知不再显示成你发的消息（#1208）：wait 结果、进程退出、后台子任务的报告，在桌面端和 WebUI 都显示为灰色的「后台通知」一行，详细输出默认折叠。这类消息不能编辑或重发，也不会进输入框的历史。\n- macOS 上窗口被挡住时，提问和回复不再晚几秒才到（#1206）：窗口被完全遮挡或最小化时，WebKit 会降低网页进程的优先级，机器忙的时候事件会晚 3–20 秒。现在主窗口关闭了遮挡检测，事件即时送达，提问的倒计时也从完整的 3 分钟开始。窗口关到托盘时仍会降速。\n内置 K-brain 的变化\n- 提问更快出现：AskUserQuestion 不再经过 AI 审查，deny 规则仍然生效（K-brain#114）。\n- 停止生成后保留已输出的回复：网关直连模式下，停止生成后，已经输出的内容会留在历史里，不再消失（K-brain#116）。\n- Windows：不带盘符的权限规则按工作区所在的盘匹配，deny 规则在 Windows 上也能生效；并发创建 worktree 不再失败（K-brain#108）。\n完整变更：https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/compare/v2.0.8...v2.0.9","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/releases/tag/v2.0.9","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","claude-code","codex","large-language-model","llm","mcp"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个本地优先的 AI Agent 桌面客户端，将大语言模型的推理能力与本地系统工具深度整合。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"LiveAgent 是一个本地优先的 AI Agent 桌面客户端。它将大语言模型的推理能力与本地系统工具深度整合，让 AI 能够真正操作你的文件系统、执行命令、管理定时任务，同时通过 Gateway 实现远程访问与协作。","tags":["claude-code","codex","mcp","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"LiveAgent is a local-first AI agent desktop client. It deeply integrates large language model reasoning with local system tools, so the AI can genuinely operate your file system, run commands, and manage scheduled tasks — while the Gateway enables remote access and collaboration.","name":"LiveAgent","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent","publisher":"Stack-Cairn","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn","releaseNotes":"LiveAgent v2.0.9\n内置 K-brain v0.107.18（#1210）。\n修复\n- 任务不会再在中途停住（#1208、K-brain#118）：模型在后台等待构建、命令或后台进程时，以前一轮对话结束就会把它们一起取消，模型再也收不到结果，任务停在半路。现在等待和后台进程会继续运行，完成后自动唤醒对话继续任务。手动停止或关闭会话时，它们仍会一起停掉。\n- 后台通知不再显示成你发的消息（#1208）：wait 结果、进程退出、后台子任务的报告，在桌面端和 WebUI 都显示为灰色的「后台通知」一行，详细输出默认折叠。这类消息不能编辑或重发，也不会进输入框的历史。\n- macOS 上窗口被挡住时，提问和回复不再晚几秒才到（#1206）：窗口被完全遮挡或最小化时，WebKit 会降低网页进程的优先级，机器忙的时候事件会晚 3–20 秒。现在主窗口关闭了遮挡检测，事件即时送达，提问的倒计时也从完整的 3 分钟开始。窗口关到托盘时仍会降速。\n内置 K-brain 的变化\n- 提问更快出现：AskUserQuestion 不再经过 AI 审查，deny 规则仍然生效（K-brain#114）。\n- 停止生成后保留已输出的回复：网关直连模式下，停止生成后，已经输出的内容会留在历史里，不再消失（K-brain#116）。\n- Windows：不带盘符的权限规则按工作区所在的盘匹配，deny 规则在 Windows 上也能生效；并发创建 worktree 不再失败（K-brain#108）。\n完整变更：https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/compare/v2.0.8...v2.0.9","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/releases/tag/v2.0.9","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","claude-code","codex","large-language-model","llm","mcp"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2